flowchart TD
    A[Bank's existing TMS / rule engine] -->|Alert webhook: alert ID, txn refs, rule fired| B[GenosAI ingestion API]
    B --> C{Alert accepted}
    C -->|On-demand API call| D[Bank core banking API]
    C -->|On-demand API call| E[Bank KYC/CDD API]
    D --> F[Evidence Gathering Agent]
    E --> F
    F --> G[Pattern Matching Agent]
    G --> H[Case and Narrative Agent]
    H --> I[Alert Queue screen]
    I -->|Analyst claims| J[Case Workspace screen]
    J -->|Officer disposition| K{Suspicion found}
    K -->|No| L[Clear - case closed]
    K -->|Yes| M[Filing Console screen]
    M -->|Attestation complete| N[goAML submission]
    N --> O[goAML Submission Tracker screen]
    L --> P[Model Governance and Audit: sampling]
    O --> P
    P --> Q[Typology and Rules Console: retuning]
    P --> R[Reporting and MI: Board/SBP rollup]
    Q --> A2[Updated detection logic feeds back]
